1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,635
Japan. Land with no known owner, mostly from inheritances never registered.

2
00:00:06,085 --> 00:00:10,663
India. Seventy-eight thousand crore rupees, unclaimed in banks.

3
00:00:11,113 --> 00:00:15,727
America. Seventeen billion dollars in life insurance, lost to families.

4
00:00:16,177 --> 00:00:19,403
Malaysia. Forty-six thousand estates, still unresolved.

5
00:00:19,853 --> 00:00:24,821
And in the Philippines, a hundred thirty-four thousand heirs needed an amnesty to catch up.

6
00:00:25,971 --> 00:00:28,729
When a parent dies, the family home freezes.

7
00:00:29,179 --> 00:00:32,541
Nothing passes to the heirs until the estate tax is settled.

8
00:00:32,991 --> 00:00:36,110
And one wrong number can cost four times the tax.

9
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:39,651
Meet Habilin. It does the work, not just the advice.

10
00:00:40,801 --> 00:00:43,362
Maria signs in, and asks in Taglish.

11
00:00:43,712 --> 00:00:48,560
Before it computes anything, it asks one question: was this the family home?

12
00:00:48,910 --> 00:00:52,562
It pulls the certified title. Fifty percent, not a hundred.

13
00:00:52,912 --> 00:00:57,782
Fixed code computes the tax from the law: one hundred fifty thousand pesos.

14
00:00:58,132 --> 00:01:01,451
Atty. Cruz signs in, and approves the exact packet.

15
00:01:01,801 --> 00:01:06,099
Ana signs in and confirms with a one-time code, never typed in chat.

16
00:01:06,449 --> 00:01:10,766
The filing reply gets lost. Habilin checks, instead of filing twice.

17
00:01:11,116 --> 00:01:14,329
It pays once, and calls it paid only when the ledger agrees.

18
00:01:14,679 --> 00:01:17,916
Then it drafts the request to the right BIR office.

19
00:01:18,266 --> 00:01:20,516
Ask it to send money to your own account?

20
00:01:20,866 --> 00:01:22,869
Refused. Whatever the chat says.

21
00:01:23,219 --> 00:01:27,853
Close the case, and personal data is deleted. The receipts stay as proof.

22
00:01:28,903 --> 00:01:32,404
The right tax. Verified receipts. Personal data deleted.

23
00:01:32,854 --> 00:01:33,358
Habilin.
